  }
}

Troubleshooting

    401 invalid_api_key: your key isn't set or isn't valid. Check echo $MODEL_API_KEY and confirm it matches a key in the dashboard.
    404 model_not_found: use a valid model ID such as muse-spark-1.3 (the default in these examples) or muse-spark-1.1 exactly.

For other status codes, retries, and error shapes, see the error handling guide.
